{"title":"Cornell MPH Biostats","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Cornell MPH Biostats"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 3.5em;\n    margin-bottom: 60px;\n    text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    animation: fadeInDown 1s ease-out;\n  }\n\n  .courses-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n    gap: 40px;\n    perspective: 1000px;\n    margin-top: 50px;\n  }\n\n  .course-card {\n    height: 300px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    position: relative;\n    transition: transform 0.6s;\n    transform-style: preserve-3d;\n  }\n\n  .course-card:hover {\n    transform: rotateY(180deg) rotateX(5deg);\n  }\n\n  .course-card-inner {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    transition: transform 0.6s;\n    transform-style: preserve-3d;\n  }\n\n  .course-card.flipped .course-card-inner {\n    transform: rotateY(180deg);\n  }\n\n  .course-front, .course-back {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    backface-visibility: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 2.5em;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .course-front {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n    color: white;\n    border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n  }\n\n  .course-back {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%);\n    color: white;\n    transform: rotateY(180deg);\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-size: 1.2em;\n    text-align: center;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  .course-back p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    font-size: 1em;\n  }\n\n  .course-card:hover .course-front {\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  }\n\n  a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: inherit;\n  }\n\n  @keyframes fadeInDown {\n    from {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(-20px);\n    }\n    to {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n  }\n\n  .course-number {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 1.2em;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    opacity: 0.9;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <h1>Welcome to Cornell MPH Biostatistics</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"courses-grid\">\n    <a href=\"course-6105.qmd\" class=\"course-link\">\n      <div class=\"course-card\">\n        <div class=\"course-card-inner\">\n          <div class=\"course-front\">\n            <div>\n              VTPEH\n              <span class=\"course-number\">6105</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"course-back\">\n            <p><strong>Biostatistics for Health Sciences</strong></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 10px;\">Introductory biostatistics with R programming</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"6270/6270/index.qmd\" class=\"course-link\">\n      <div class=\"course-card\">\n        <div class=\"course-card-inner\">\n          <div class=\"course-front\">\n            <div>\n              VTPEH\n              <span class=\"course-number\">6270</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"course-back\">\n            <p><strong>Advanced Topics</strong></p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 10px;\">Advanced biostatistics methods</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('.course-card').forEach(card => {\n    card.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n      if (e.target.closest('a')) {\n        // Let the link handle navigation\n        return;\n      }\n      this.classList.toggle('flipped');\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    color: white;\n    font-size: 3.5em;\n    margin-bottom: 60px;\n    text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    animation: fadeInDown 1s ease-out;\n  }\n\n  .courses-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));\n    gap: 40px;\n    perspective: 1000px;\n    margin-top: 50px;\n  }\n\n  .course-card {\n    height: 300px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    position: relative;\n    transition: transform 0.6s;\n    transform-style: preserve-3d;\n  }\n\n  .course-card:hover {\n    transform: rotateY(180deg) rotateX(5deg);\n  }\n\n  .course-card-inner {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    transition: transform 0.6s;\n    transform-style: preserve-3d;\n  }\n\n  .course-card.flipped .course-card-inner {\n    transform: rotateY(180deg);\n  }\n\n  .course-front, .course-back {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    backface-visibility: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 2.5em;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .course-front {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n    color: white;\n    border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\n  }\n\n  .course-back {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%);\n    color: white;\n    transform: r